opes who'd try to stand in your way. \n\n\nBANGIN' SOUNDTRACK\nEnjoy the music that's made waves online, and learn it to a T as you put your rhythm to the test hitting notes in time. Largely composed by KawaiSprite and Saruky, with industry talent collaborations like Lotus Juice of 'Persona 3' fame and Kohta Takahashi of 'Ridge Racer 4' fame. With over 60+ original songs currently in the game, there's plenty to master. \n\n\nINTERACTIVE CARTOON EXCELLENCE\nHand drawn, lovingly made 2D visuals. Every stage unique, every enemy special, and made right in Adobe Flash. The art and animations of PhantomArcade bring the Newgrounds spirit to phones in full force. And with more levels, cutscenes, and playable characters on the way... the amount of eye candy The Funkin Crew will bring has no end in sight.\n\nThe internet classic with 200+ million players is finally here on the App Store, in its best form yet\n\n\n\n\n\nOther features include\n\n+ Gameplay overseen by Tom Fulp\n\n+ Code by Ninjamuffin99\n\n+ Sky Mod (wait thats not in this)\n\n+ JohnnyUtah voice acting\n\n+ Hot(?) characters!\n\n+ 18 years worth of gameplay", "contentAdvisoryRating": "12+", "averageUserRating": 4.77257, "minimumOsVersion": "16.0", "trackCensoredName": "Friday Night Funkin' Mobile", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/friday-night-funkin-mobile/id6740428530?uo=4", "sellerName": "The Funkin' Crew Incorporated", "price": 0.0, "releaseNotes": "Hey, hope you’re enjoying Funkin’ on the go!\n\nWe’ve been hard at work to make the game better for you:\n\n- Upgraded our input system to SDL3, with nanosecond precision for super accurate scoring!\n- The rank slam animation now properly plays its glow effect when the capsule slams.\n- Fixed various visual issues throughout the game.\n- And even more fixes!\n\nThanks for playing! We stayed up way past our bedtime working on it, so it means a lot.", "genreIds": ["6014", "7001", "7011"], "releaseDate": "2025-07-15T07:00:00Z", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "userRatingCount": 875}]}